{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":51,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the choir director. A Psalm of David, when Nathan the prophet came to him, after he had gone in to Bath-sheba","tok":[{"t":"To the choir director. A "},{"t":"Psalm","s":["H4210"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[2]},{"t":", when "},{"t":"Nathan","s":["H5416"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"prophet","s":["H5030"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"came","s":["H0935"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to him, after he had gone "},{"t":"in","s":["H0935"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Bath","s":["H1339"],"a":[10]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"sheba","s":["H1339"],"a":[10]}]},{"n":1,"text":"Be gracious to me, O God, according to Your lovingkindness; According to the greatness of Your compassions blot out my transgressions.","tok":[{"t":"Be gracious to me, O "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":", according to Your "},{"t":"lovingkindness","s":["H2617"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; According to the greatness of Your compassions blot "},{"t":"out","s":["H4229"],"a":[5]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"transgressions","s":["H6588"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Wash me thoroughly from my iniquity, And from my sin cleanse me.","tok":[{"t":"Wash","s":["H3526"],"a":[1]},{"t":" me thoroughly from my "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H5771"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And from "},{"t":"my","s":["H2891"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sin","s":["H2403"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"cleanse","s":["H2891"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"me","s":["H2403"],"a":[3]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"For I do know my transgressions, And my sin is before me continually.","tok":[{"t":"For I do know my "},{"t":"transgressions","s":["H6588"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And my "},{"t":"sin","s":["H2403"],"a":[4]},{"t":" is before me continually."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Against You and You alone have I sinned, And I have done what is evil in Your sight. Therefore You are righteous when You speak; You are clear when You judge.","tok":[{"t":"Against You and You alone have I "},{"t":"sinned","s":["H2398"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And I have "},{"t":"done","s":["H6213"],"a":[5]},{"t":" what is "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in Your "},{"t":"sight","s":["H5869"],"a":[4]},{"t":". Therefore You are righteous when You "},{"t":"speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; You are "},{"t":"clear","s":["H2135"],"a":[9]},{"t":" when You "},{"t":"judge","s":["H8199"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Behold, I was brought forth in iniquity, And in sin did my mother conceive me.","tok":[{"t":"Behold, I was brought forth in "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H5771"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And in "},{"t":"sin","s":["H2399"],"a":[3]},{"t":" did my "},{"t":"mother","s":["H0517"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"conceive","s":["H3179"],"a":[4]},{"t":" me."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Behold, You delight in truth in the inward parts; And in the hidden part You would make known wisdom to me.","tok":[{"t":"Behold, You delight in "},{"t":"truth","s":["H0571"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in the inward "},{"t":"parts","s":["H2910"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; And in the "},{"t":"hidden","s":["H5640"],"a":[4]},{"t":" part You would make known "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to me."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Purge my sin with hyssop, and I will be clean; Wash me, and I will be whiter than snow.","tok":[{"t":"Purge","s":["H2398"],"a":[0]},{"t":" my sin with "},{"t":"hyssop","s":["H0231"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and I will be "},{"t":"clean","s":["H2891"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Wash","s":["H3526"],"a":[3]},{"t":" me, and I will be "},{"t":"whiter","s":["H3835"],"a":[5]},{"t":" than "},{"t":"snow","s":["H7950"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Let me hear gladness and joy, That the bones which You have broken may exult.","tok":[{"t":"Let me "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"gladness","s":["H8057"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"joy","s":["H8342"],"a":[1]},{"t":", That the "},{"t":"bones","s":["H6106"],"a":[4]},{"t":" which You have "},{"t":"broken","s":["H1794"],"a":[5]},{"t":" may exult."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Hide Your face from my sins, And blot out all